# SECTION 1: CREATE TICKETS - CUSTOMER ONLY

### 1.1 Create Ticket - High Priority Bug
POST {{tickets_url}}
Authorization: Bearer {{customer_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "To finish token pap",
  "description": "Users cannot log into the system. Login button shows error 'Invalid credentials' even with correct password.",
  "category": "Bug",
  "priority": 3
}

### Expected: 200 OK - Ticket created, returns TicketResponseDto with ID


### 1.2 Create Ticket - Medium Priority
POST {{tickets_url}}
Authorization: Bearer {{customer_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Internet Performance Issue",
  "description": "Dashboard takes 30+ seconds to load. Need performance optimization for better user experience.",
  "category": "Performance",
  "priority": 2
}

### Expected: 200 OK - Second ticket created

### 1.3 Create Ticket - Critical Priority
POST {{tickets_url}}
Authorization: Bearer {{customer_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Database Postres",
  "description": "Production database connection failing. Multiple users affected. URGENT! This is blocking all operations.",
  "category": "Critical",
  "priority": 4
}

### Expected: 200 OK - Third ticket created


### 1.4 Create Ticket - Low Priority
POST {{tickets_url}}
Authorization: Bearer {{customer_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "UI Button Color Inconsistency",
  "description": "Some buttons have different colors. Please standardize all button colors for visual consistency.",
  "category": "UI",
  "priority": 1
}

### Expected: 200 OK - Fourth ticket created


*****
### 1.5 Technician Tries to Create Ticket (Should Fail)
### Only Customers can create tickets
POST {{tickets_url}}
Authorization: Bearer {{technician_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Test Ticket",
  "description": "This is a test ticket from technician which should fail",
  "category": "Test",
  "priority": 2
}

### Expected: 403 Forbidden - "Only customers can create tickets"

###

### 1.6 Create Ticket Without Authorization (Should Fail)
POST {{tickets_url}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Test Ticket",
  "description": "This is a test ticket without authorization which should fail",
  "category": "Test",
  "priority": 2
}

### Expected: 401 Unauthorized - "Authorization header missing"

###

### 1.7 Create Ticket with Title Too Short (Should Fail)
POST {{tickets_url}}
Authorization: Bearer {{customer_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "AB",
  "description": "Description is fine but title is too short",
  "category": "Test",
  "priority": 2
}

### Expected: 400 Bad Request - "Title must be at least 3 characters"

###

### 1.8 Create Ticket with Description Too Short (Should Fail)
POST {{tickets_url}}
Authorization: Bearer {{customer_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Valid Title",
  "description": "Short",
  "category": "Test",
  "priority": 2
}

### Expected: 400 Bad Request - "Description must be at least 10 characters"

###

### 1.9 Create Ticket with Missing Required Field (Should Fail)
POST {{tickets_url}}
Authorization: Bearer {{customer_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Valid Title",
  "category": "Test",
  "priority": 2
}

### Expected: 400 Bad Request - "Description is required"



# SECTION 2: GET TICKETS - RETRIEVE ALL TICKETS


### 2.1 Get All Tickets (Paginated)
GET {{tickets_url}}?pageNumber=1&pageSize=10
Authorization: Bearer {{customer_token}}

### Expected: 200 OK - Returns PaginatedResponseDto with list of tickets

###

### 2.2 Get All Tickets - Page 2
GET {{tickets_url}}?pageNumber=2&pageSize=5
Authorization: Bearer {{customer_token}}

### Expected: 200 OK - Second page of tickets (if exists)


*****
### 2.3 Get Ticket by ID
### Replace {{ticket_id}} with actual ID from section 1.1
GET {{tickets_url}}/{{ticket_id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{customer_token}}

### Expected: 200 OK - Full ticket details including comments and activity log

###

### 2.4 Get Non-existent Ticket (Should Fail)
GET {{tickets_url}}/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
Authorization: Bearer {{customer_token}}

### Expected: 404 Not Found - "Ticket not found"

###

### 2.5 Get Ticket Without Authorization (Should Fail)
GET {{tickets_url}}/{{ticket_id}}

### Expected: 401 Unauthorized - "Authorization header missing"

###

# SECTION 3: GET TICKETS BY STATUS

# Status: Open=1, InProgress=2, Resolved=3, Reopened=4, Closed=5

### 3.1 Get All Open Tickets (Status = 1)
GET {{tickets_url}}/by-status/1?pageNumber=1&pageSize=10
Authorization: Bearer {{customer_token}}

### Expected: 200 OK - Only tickets with status Open


### 3.2 Get All InProgress Tickets (Status = 2)
GET {{tickets_url}}/by-status/2?pageNumber=1&pageSize=10
Authorization: Bearer {{customer_token}}

### Expected: 200 OK - Only tickets with status InProgress


### 3.3 Get All Resolved Tickets (Status = 3)
GET {{tickets_url}}/by-status/3?pageNumber=1&pageSize=10
Authorization: Bearer {{customer_token}}

### Expected: 200 OK - Only tickets with status Resolved


### 3.4 Get All Reopened Tickets (Status = 4)
GET {{tickets_url}}/by-status/4?pageNumber=1&pageSize=10
Authorization: Bearer {{customer_token}}

### Expected: 200 OK - Only tickets with status Reopened


### 3.5 Get All Closed Tickets (Status = 5)
GET {{tickets_url}}/by-status/5?pageNumber=1&pageSize=10
Authorization: Bearer {{customer_token}}

### Expected: 200 OK - Only tickets with status Closed


### 3.6 Get Tickets with Invalid Status (Should Fail)
GET {{tickets_url}}/by-status/99?pageNumber=1&pageSize=10
Authorization: Bearer {{customer_token}}

### Expected: 400 Bad Request - "Invalid status value"

###


# SECTION 4: GET MY TICKETS - CUSTOMER VIEWS OWN TICKETS


### 4.1 Get My Created Tickets
GET {{tickets_url}}/my-tickets?pageNumber=1&pageSize=10
Authorization: Bearer {{customer_token}}

### Expected: 200 OK - Only tickets created by this customer

###

### 4.2 Get My Tickets - Second Page
GET {{tickets_url}}/my-tickets?pageNumber=2&pageSize=5
Authorization: Bearer {{customer_token}}

### Expected: 200 OK - Second page of my tickets (if exists)


### 4.3 Get My Tickets Without Authorization (Should Fail)
GET {{tickets_url}}/my-tickets
Authorization: Bearer

### Expected: 401 Unauthorized - "Authorization header missing"

###


# SECTION 5: GET ASSIGNED TICKETS - TECHNICIAN VIEWS ASSIGNMENTS


### 5.1 Get Tickets Assigned to Me (Technician)
GET {{tickets_url}}/assigned-to-me?pageNumber=1&pageSize=10
Authorization: Bearer {{technician_token}}

### Expected: 200 OK - Only tickets assigned to this technician (excludes closed)


### 5.2 Get Assigned Tickets - Second Page
GET {{tickets_url}}/assigned-to-me?pageNumber=2&pageSize=5
Authorization: Bearer {{technician_token}}

### Expected: 200 OK - Second page of assigned tickets

###

# SECTION 6: UPDATE TICKETS - CUSTOMER UPDATES OWN TICKETS


### 6.1 Update Ticket Title
### Replace {{ticket_id}} with actual ID
PUT {{tickets_url}}/{{ticket_id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{customer_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "LOGIN PAGE NOT WORKING - URGENT FIX REQUIRED"
}

### Expected: 200 OK - Ticket updated, activity logged


### 6.2 Update Ticket Description
PUT {{tickets_url}}/{{ticket_id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{customer_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "description": "CRITICAL ISSUE: Multiple users unable to log into the system. This is blocking production access for all users worldwide."
}

### Expected: 200 OK - Description updated

###

### 6.3 Update Ticket Priority
PUT {{tickets_url}}/{{ticket_id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{customer_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "priority": 4
}

### Expected: 200 OK - Priority updated to Critical

###

### 6.4 Update Ticket Category
PUT {{tickets_url}}/{{ticket_id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{customer_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "category": "System Critical"
}

### Expected: 200 OK - Category updated

###

### 6.5 Update Multiple Fields at Once
PUT {{tickets_url}}/{{ticket_id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{customer_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Login Issue - System Down",
  "description": "Users cannot access the system. All login attempts failing.",
  "priority": 4,
  "category": "System Critical"
}

### Expected: 200 OK - All fields updated in one request

###

### 6.6 Update Non-existent Ticket (Should Fail)
PUT {{tickets_url}}/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
Authorization: Bearer {{customer_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Updated Title"
}

### Expected: 404 Not Found - "Ticket not found"

###


*******
### 6.7 Update Ticket Without Authorization (Should Fail)
PUT {{tickets_url}}/{{ticket_id}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Updated Title"
}

### Expected: 401 Unauthorized - "Authorization header missing"


### 6.8 Update Someone Else's Ticket (Should Fail)
### Customer 1 tries to update Customer 2's ticket
PUT {{tickets_url}}/{{ticket_id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{customer_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Hacker Title"
}

### Expected: 403 Forbidden - "You don't have permission to update this ticket"



# SECTION 7: ASSIGN TICKETS - TECHNICIAN ASSIGNMENT


### 7.1 Assign Ticket to Technician
### Replace {{ticket_id}} and {{technician_id}} with actual IDs
PATCH {{tickets_url}}/{{ticket_id}}/assign
Authorization: Bearer {{teamlead_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "assignedToUserId": "{{technician_id}}",
  "reason": "Assigned for immediate resolution based on priority"
}

### Expected: 200 OK - Ticket assigned, activity logged

###

### 7.2 Assign to Non-existent Technician (Should Fail)
PATCH {{tickets_url}}/{{ticket_id}}/assign
Authorization: Bearer {{teamlead_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "assignedToUserId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000",
  "reason": "Testing invalid ID"
}

### Expected: 400 Bad Request - "Technician not found"

###

### 7.3 Customer Tries to Assign (Should Fail)
### Only technicians/teamleads can assign
PATCH {{tickets_url}}/{{ticket_id}}/assign
Authorization: Bearer {{customer_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "assignedToUserId": "{{technician_id}}",
  "reason": "Testing unauthorized access"
}

### Expected: 403 Forbidden - "Only technicians can assign tickets"

###


# SECTION 8: CHANGE TICKET STATUS - TECHNICIAN UPDATES STATUS

# Status: Open=1, InProgress=2, Resolved=3, Reopened=4, Closed=5

### 8.1 Change Status to InProgress (2)
PATCH {{tickets_url}}/{{ticket_id}}/status
Authorization: Bearer {{technician_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": 2,
  "reason": "Started investigating the issue immediately"
}

### Expected: 200 OK - Status changed, activity logged

###

### 8.2 Change Status to Resolved (3)
PATCH {{tickets_url}}/{{ticket_id}}/status
Authorization: Bearer {{technician_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": 3,
  "reason": "Issue has been fixed and tested in production"
}

### Expected: 200 OK - Status changed to Resolved

###

### 8.3 Change Status to Reopened (4)
PATCH {{tickets_url}}/{{ticket_id}}/status
Authorization: Bearer {{technician_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": 4,
  "reason": "Customer reported issue still exists in production"
}

### Expected: 200 OK - Status changed to Reopened

###

### 8.4 Change Status to Closed (5)
PATCH {{tickets_url}}/{{ticket_id}}/status
Authorization: Bearer {{technician_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": 5,
  "reason": "Confirmed resolved by customer after re-testing"
}

### Expected: 200 OK - Status changed to Closed

###

### 8.5 Change to Invalid Status (Should Fail)
PATCH {{tickets_url}}/{{ticket_id}}/status
Authorization: Bearer {{technician_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": 99,
  "reason": "Testing invalid status"
}

### Expected: 400 Bad Request - "Invalid status value"

###

### 8.6 Customer Changes Status (Should Fail)
### Only technicians can change status
PATCH {{tickets_url}}/{{ticket_id}}/status
Authorization: Bearer {{customer_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": 2,
  "reason": "Testing unauthorized access"
}

### Expected: 403 Forbidden - "Only assigned technician can change status"

###



# SECTION 9: CLOSE TICKET - MARK AS COMPLETE


### 9.1 Close Ticket (Alternative to status change)
DELETE {{tickets_url}}/{{ticket_id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{technician_token}}

### Expected: 200 OK - Ticket marked as closed

###

### 9.2 Close Already Closed Ticket (Should Fail)
DELETE {{tickets_url}}/{{ticket_id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{technician_token}}

### Expected: 400 Bad Request - "Ticket is already closed"

###

### 9.3 Close Non-existent Ticket (Should Fail)
DELETE {{tickets_url}}/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
Authorization: Bearer {{technician_token}}

### Expected: 404 Not Found - "Ticket not found"

###


# SECTION 10: COMMENTS - ADD AND VIEW TICKET COMMENTS


### 10.1 Add Comment Without Attachment
POST {{tickets_url}}/{{ticket_id}}/comments
Authorization: Bearer {{technician_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "comment": "I have started investigating this issue. Will provide updates within 2 hours.",
  "attachmentUrl": null
}

### Expected: 200 OK - Comment added, returns TicketCommentDto
### IMPORTANT: Copy comment ID from response and update @comment_id above

###

### 10.2 Add Comment With Attachment URL
POST {{tickets_url}}/{{ticket_id}}/comments
Authorization: Bearer {{technician_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "comment": "Found the root cause. See attached error log for details. The issue is in the authentication module.",
  "attachmentUrl": "https://example.com/logs/error-log-2024-03-06.pdf"
}

### Expected: 200 OK - Comment with attachment added

###

### 10.3 Add Resolution Comment
POST {{tickets_url}}/{{ticket_id}}/comments
Authorization: Bearer {{technician_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "comment": "Issue resolved. Login functionality is now working correctly for all users. Please test and confirm.",
  "attachmentUrl": "https://example.com/fixes/deployment-summary.txt"
}

### Expected: 200 OK - Comment added

###

### 10.4 Add Comment Too Short (Should Fail)
POST {{tickets_url}}/{{ticket_id}}/comments
Authorization: Bearer {{technician_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "comment": "Short",
  "attachmentUrl": null
}

### Expected: 400 Bad Request - "Comment must be 5-5000 characters"

###

### 10.5 Add Comment Too Long (Should Fail)
### More than 5000 characters
POST {{tickets_url}}/{{ticket_id}}/comments
Authorization: Bearer {{technician_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "comment": "This is a very long comment that exceeds the maximum allowed length of 5000 characters. Let me add more text to reach that limit. Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet...",
  "attachmentUrl": null
}

### Expected: 400 Bad Request - "Comment must be 5-5000 characters"

###

### 10.6 Add Comment Without Authorization (Should Fail)
POST {{tickets_url}}/{{ticket_id}}/comments
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "comment": "This should fail without authorization",
  "attachmentUrl": null
}

### Expected: 401 Unauthorized

###

### 10.7 Get All Comments for Ticket
GET {{tickets_url}}/{{ticket_id}}/comments
Authorization: Bearer {{customer_token}}

### Expected: 200 OK - List of all comments in reverse chronological order (newest first)

###

### 10.8 Get Comments from Non-existent Ticket (Should Fail)
GET {{tickets_url}}/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000/comments
Authorization: Bearer {{customer_token}}

### Expected: 404 Not Found - "Ticket not found"

###

# SECTION 11: DELETE COMMENTS - COMMENT AUTHOR ONLY


### 11.1 Delete Your Own Comment
### Replace {{comment_id}} with actual ID from section 10.1
DELETE {{tickets_url}}/comments/{{comment_id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{technician_token}}

### Expected: 200 OK - Comment deleted

###

### 11.2 Delete Non-existent Comment (Should Fail)
DELETE {{tickets_url}}/comments/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
Authorization: Bearer {{technician_token}}

### Expected: 404 Not Found - "Comment not found"

###

### 11.3 Delete Someone Else's Comment (Should Fail)
### You can only delete your own comments
DELETE {{tickets_url}}/comments/{{comment_id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{customer_token}}

### Expected: 403 Forbidden - "You can only delete your own comments"

###


# SECTION 12: ACTIVITY LOG - VIEW TICKET HISTORY


### 12.1 Get Complete Ticket Activity Log
GET {{tickets_url}}/{{ticket_id}}/activity
Authorization: Bearer {{customer_token}}

### Expected: 200 OK - List of all changes:
### - Creation
### - Updates (title, description, priority, category)
### - Status changes (Open → InProgress → Resolved, etc.)
### - Assignments
### - Comments


### 12.2 Get Activity Log - Non-existent Ticket (Should Fail)
GET {{tickets_url}}/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000/activity
Authorization: Bearer {{customer_token}}

### Expected: 404 Not Found - "Ticket not found"

